The sorted expert gather (gather_qmm_rhs_sm80) also takes affine weights. Upstream gates it to the
floating point modes, so a 4-bit affine expert bank runs qmm_sm80 with one block per (row, expert)
pair on grid z, which exceeds the 65,535 block limit at 8192 prefill rows x top-10 experts.

